    "rich_text_DBnqLn": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "custom_css": [
        ".rte {text-align: left;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_width": "wide",
        "title": "",
        "content": "<p><strong>YOUR GO TO FOR EVERYTHING, PAINT, AIRBRUSHING, SCULPTING TOOLS, AND MORE!</strong></p><p>Hearns Hobbies has grown over many of its operating years, as such we have become known for stocking some of the finest and most sought after sculpting/modelling tools, various types of high quality paints, and even a wide range of different airbrushes, compressors and more!<br/><br/>We are leading supplier for hobbies in Melbourne and in Australia since 1947; since then we have been committed to bringing into Australia, exotic, and highly reputable (and quality) paints and tools. Some of which are the very best in the industry! From budget products right through to the \"crème de la crème\" of paints, tools and airbrush ranges.<br/><br/>Key brands and leading manufacturer of our Paints & Tools include: <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/tamiya\">Tamiya</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/iwata\">Iwata</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/godhand\">Godhands</a>, <a href=\"https://hearnshobbies.myshopify.com/collections/ninesteps-industries\">Ninesteps Industries </a>and many more.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
      }
    },
